{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Northern Finland, no one can hear you die.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Death Comes Skiing</i> is a comedic point-and-click murder mystery set in the ruthless world of Nordic winter sports. The events take place in Northern Finland, on a desolate mountain near the Norwegian border. A retired Finnish cross-country ski team meets for the weekend to celebrate their past victories, but one by one the old ski legends start dying under suspicious circumstances. What dark secrets lie buried under the icy slopes of time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422230/extras/custom_viivi_bw.png?t=1756033988\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into the sneakers of Viivi, the granddaughter of one of the old athletes. She loves detective stories and mysteries, so when strange things start to happen, it's time for her to dig out her magnifying glass and start snooping around! Search for clues and solve puzzles around the mansion to figure out why everyone is acting so suspicious and what's the real reason behind all the mindless butchery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers hours of gruesome murder fun with fancy hand-drawn graphics \u2013 and a story of Nordic winter sports that's more accurate than anyone involved would like to admit.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3422230?t=1756033988","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422230/a9fe9b9d759cb6cc23c21aedf552311586087fb1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756033988","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422230/d813c896ddd1896298aba7a27c5a7c4903c6254b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756033988","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422230/d813c896ddd1896298aba7a27c5a7c4903c6254b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756033988","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"As a murder mystery, the game contains scenes of cartoon violence and death. It also includes alcohol and drug use and some strong language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Northern Finland, no one can hear you die.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Death Comes Skiing</i> is a comedic point-and-click murder mystery set in the ruthless world of Nordic winter sports. The events take place in Northern Finland, on a desolate mountain near the Norwegian border. A retired Finnish cross-country ski team meets for the weekend to celebrate their past victories, but one by one the old ski legends start dying under suspicious circumstances. What dark secrets lie buried under the icy slopes of time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422230/extras/custom_viivi_bw.png?t=1756033988\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into the sneakers of Viivi, the granddaughter of one of the old athletes. She loves detective stories and mysteries, so when strange things start to happen, it's time for her to dig out her magnifying glass and start snooping around! Search for clues and solve puzzles around the mansion to figure out why everyone is acting so suspicious and what's the real reason behind all the mindless butchery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers hours of gruesome murder fun with fancy hand-drawn graphics \u2013 and a story of Nordic winter sports that's more accurate than anyone involved would like to admit.</p>","developers":["Valtteri Tavast"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/